      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.87,
      "end_seconds": 251.48,
      "duration_seconds": 6.61,
      "text": "It's a small superficial burn with an intact blister, about the size of a palm."
